<FONT COLOR="#FFFFFF" face="sans-serif">Hello everyone.  Just browsed the site for the first time in about a month or so.  Good to see the people that are still in <IMG SRC="/phpBB/images/smiles/icon_smile.gif">.  Unfortunantly, due to a number of reasons (although primarily because all of my real life friends that played EQ quit, including Overon <IMG SRC="/phpBB/images/smiles/icon_frown.gif">) I have decided that this game is no longer a worthwhile investment of my time.  I guess on that note I have a few things I'd like to say to you guys.  First off, I'd really like to thank you very much for allowing me into your great guild.  You are all great people and treated me with far more kindness and appreciation than I deserved, even upon when I first entered the guild.  Rest assured that your generosity towards me is greatly appreciated.  I'm sorry if I let anyone down by doing this.  I wanted to do what I could to help make things better and help everyone out the best I could.  However, I'm very happy to see that all of the people that are still in OoO are still here.  I'm really sorry for leaving.  I guess I don't really know how much any of my friends or any Schism members or members of other guilds that I knew in OoO stop by this sight, but I would also like to say thank you to you all as well.  Hehe, I guess I'm kind of rambling, but everyone that played this game was so nice to me <IMG SRC="/phpBB/images/smiles/icon_smile.gif">.  Please know that I don't have any bad feelings towards anyone about the unfortunante split.  Thank you all once again for how kind and generous you (OoO members, but I hope that any of my other friends are reading this as well) were to me.  You are all wonderful people and may God bless all of you <IMG SRC="/phpBB/images/smiles/icon_smile.gif">.  Rest assured I'll be dropping by every once and a while though <IMG SRC="/phpBB/images/smiles/icon_smile.gif">.  Anywho, I'll stop my ramblings for now so everyone who's reading this can get back to something more useful with their time <IMG SRC="/phpBB/images/smiles/icon_smile.gif">.</FONT><BR>
